        "description": "<p>Provide products&#8217; advantages and disadvantages in the simplest way possible. Free pros and cons plugin with different templates and the ability to generate pros and cons structured data.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<p>Just install and activate it. After that, you can change its style, font, colors, and so on&#8230;</p>\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.1.4</h4>\n<p><em>Add width/height attributes to img tags</em></p>\n<h4>1.1.3</h4>\n<p><em>Change init hook to plugins_loaded for load_plugin_textdomain</em><br />\n<em>Tested up to 6.7</em></p>\n<h4>1.1.2</h4>\n<p><em>Fix default text and background color of the title</em></p>\n<h4>1.1.1</h4>\n<p><em>Empty script tag fixed</em><br />\n<em>Display name instead of nice name</em></p>\n<h4>1.1.0</h4>\n<p><em>Settings link added in plugins page</em><br />\n<em>Keyword added</em></p>\n<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<p><em>Release Date &#8211; 06 February 2024</em></p>\n"
    },
